{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>הריב</b> (the quarrel) — bet. אשר להם הריב (who have the quarrel), לפני התגלע הריב (before the quarrel breaks out), נטוש (cast down) — this teaches: once the matter comes before you for judgment and you know which way the judgment leans, you are not permitted to withdraw. For once the men who have the quarrel stand and the judges investigate etc., they must judge between them. But before the quarrel breaks out — cast down."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "The three Hebrew phrases appear to be the three occurrences of ריב with bet-prefix that the Ba'al HaTurim is enumerating; the word נטוש is obscure and may be corrupt or a truncated tag — translated hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:04.385132054Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}